option and guest socket authentication, build/golden/send-receive deploy, then provi\n755:| Codex dead_scope1 — ACTIVE | dead-code bridge scope 1; suppressed candidates only | mutation_engine.rs, identity_sled_dispatch.rs; Luna Cargo worker | 2026-10-05 | Exclude tched_catalog_binding.rs and tched_route\n756:| Codex workspace_socket_egress — ACTIVE | Owner explicitly requires full TCP/UDP without NIC, using container loopback like Xray; HTTP-only proposal superseded | /home/jeremy/odbus-provision-fuse; root notes, prov\n762:| Codex bridge_seccomp — ACTIVE POLICY VERIFIED | bridge-btrfs-seccomp-20261005: owner-approved filter installed; last bridge PID29256 healthy, NoNewPrivs1/Seccomp2/filter1 | `/home/jeremy/odbus-bridge-seccomp`, ba\n763:| Codex provision_fuse — ACTIVE | identity-provision-fuse-20261005: attach session-scoped 3tchedFS during identity provisioning and set hostname to session ID | Isolated `/home/jeremy/odbus-provision-fuse`, branch \n778:| Codex provider_error — ACTIVE | chat-provider-rejection-20261004: OpenCode and OpenAI/Astra fail with discarded native provider diagnostics; preserve bounded category/status | Root owns tched_router_generation_na\n781:| Composer (Cursor) — ACTIVE | golden-deploy-activate-20261004: snapshot `20261004T031142Z-5536eda` remains current. Door hotfix is up: `/usr/local/bin/op-grpc-bridge` → workspace `target/release/op-grpc-bridge`,","is_error":false}]}
