uilt, pending your approval of the socket-permission change.\n- Sealing the catalog failed with \"threetched plugin contract must be captured before sealing\". `op-uds-relay` and `threetched` were not built.\n- The seed's 3tchedFS service was installed, but its preflight was missing three inputs that come from the catalog.\n- That session committed nothing and pushed nothing.\n\n**That snapshot is now two days old.** HANDOFF shows Codex deployed a rebuilt release at 2026-10-18 16:51Z (slot A active, release `321fdc18…`, ten services running). The repo also has checkpoint commits `7766577` and `051a20d` from Oct 18, and a Hermes bootstrap one-shot is active today from 01:15 to 02:15Z. I haven't checked the current network state, so the \"live\" table above shouldn't be trusted as current. The old Claude row in HANDOFF (line 677) still reads \"HANDED OFF (owner switching to pi)\".\n\nI also did the nine-skill preload that AGENTS.md requires. Want me to compare the current live network against that topology?"}]}
